		(descr "Xinyangze YZP0048-20048-04025-03 (LCSC C5126845): 4-pin magnetic pogo male, through-hole, 2.50 mm pitch; body 21.20 x 6.86 mm stadium (R3.43) with a 5.03 x 2.31 mm tab, 2.80 thick, magnets 15.41 mm apart; pins 4.10 free / 3.10 working / 2.90 pressed; tails 0.60 x 0.70 mm. From Xinyangze's drawing (2022-03-24): its recommended land is 4 x 0.80 mm holes in 2.20 mm pads at 2.50; here the pads are 1.50 mm so the inner face clears the AAA clips' steel feet. EasyEDA's land for C5126845 stacks a 2.2 mm SMD pad on a 0.85 mm through-hole pad with a 0.75 mm drill (0.05 mm ring), not used.")
